  "rulings_decided_pending_owner_review": {
    "R1": "reconstruction-mode omission of excluded unknown_availability/future_knowledge evidence rows for ef3.relative_stats kept as documented exception; shared FeatureResult validator not amended now",
    "R2": "evidence_limit is result-wide; fixtures list per-output witnesses; single-output runs reproduce them",
    "R3": "excluded/ineligible witnesses use boundary ordinary; INELIGIBLE reason reused for declared exclusions",
    "R4": "ratified 2026-10-27 (decided, pending owner review; earlier proposal withdrawn): code and frozen contract win. Roster-level knowledge findings are population-wide and evaluated before the group filter, so an other-group roster row with null or future known_at blocks a group-scoped result; unselected roles are not validated; the snapshot id is shared by every delivered role including population (source_id not compared). No code change",
    "R5": "known_at of bounds/population/edge facts carried, not gated in merged code; ruled 2026-10-27 (decided, pending owner review): gate on the knowledge cutoff for facts used by a selected output (null -> UNKNOWN_AVAILABILITY, later -> FUTURE_KNOWLEDGE); needs amendment E-A2 and library work",
    "R6": "absent-role behavior and builders evidence_limit=0 default are implementation choices, ruled (decided, pending owner review)",
    "R7": "RB28 non-positive factor_den clause unreachable behind RB10 (UNSUPPORTED_ADJUSTMENT): contract nit; merged behavior ruled (decided, pending owner review)",
    "R8": "P18 not buildable literally; alternate construction ruled (decided, pending owner review)",
    "manifest_result":"16 manifest lines matching EF3 names are exactly the 16 session_breadth headers (name and unit match, planned_delivery EF3); other 36 headers have no exact manifest entry; two EF3 manifest entries have no header: relative.session.primary.beta_residual_fraction, relative.session.secondary.beta_residual_fraction (EQ-153); reconciled 2026-10-27 (decided, pending owner review): 36 headers added as ef3_delivered_outputs entries; the two entries without a header kept and marked delivered false with a superseded_note; checker asserts parity",
    "not_reverified_by_reviewer":"R3, R7 and worker-layer claims of R9 (R9 rests on D and F worker docs; E worker not yet merged)",
    "R9": "refusal codes collapse to INVALID_COMMAND at the worker layer as in EF2; revised 2026-10-27 (decided, pending owner review): category collapse stays but a closed contract_code field preserves the shared ErrorCode (breadth/adaptive worker also maps INCONSISTENT_IDENTITY to RESULT_IDENTITY_MISMATCH and OVERFLOW to CALCULATION_FAILED)"
  }
